---
// Gemella inglese di src/pages/privacy-policy.astro. Traduzione tecnica del
// testo legale: nomi propri (Google Ireland Limited, OpenFreeMap, maplibre-gl),
// nomi di cookie e norme (GDPR, ePrivacy) restano invariati.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { contatti } from '../../data/contatti.ts';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Amon Energy S.r.l.'s privacy notice on the processing of personal data."
  headerTransparent={false}
>
  <section class="wrap py-20 lg:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-display">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="measure text-body mt-10">
        <p>
          {contatti.ragioneSociale}, registered office at {contatti.indirizzo}, Italy, VAT no. {contatti.piva} ("Data
          Controller"), processes the personal data of this website's users in compliance with
          Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR), applicable Italian law and, for cookies, the ePrivacy
          Directive and the guidelines of the Italian Data Protection Authority (Garante).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-subhead mt-10">Data processed</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          This website does not contain contact forms. The only personal data processed by the
          Data Controller is the data users provide voluntarily when contacting the company by
          phone ({contatti.telefono}) or email ({contatti.email}, {contatti.pec}).
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-subhead mt-10">Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The banner shown on first visit asks for consent before enabling any cookie that is not
          strictly necessary; you can change your choice at any time from the "Cookie preferences"
          link in the footer.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-5 overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="text-small w-full border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-navy-200 text-left">
                <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-ink">Category</th>
                <th class="py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-ink">Purpose</th>
                <th class="py-2 font-semibold text-ink">Consent</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="text-ink/80">
              <tr class="border-b border-navy-100">
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-ink">Necessary</td>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4">
                  None currently in use: the site works without setting any first-party technical
                  cookies.
                </td>
                <td class="py-3">Not required</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4 font-medium text-ink">Statistics</td>
                <td class="py-3 pr-4">
                  Google Analytics 4 — statistical measurement of traffic (pages visited, source,
                  device). The script only loads after choosing "Accept all" in the banner: without
                  consent it is neither requested nor run. The IP address is anonymised before
                  being recorded.
                </td>
                <td class="py-3">Required, revocable</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5">
          The Google Analytics 4 service is provided by Google Ireland Limited (Gordon House,
          Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland), which processes the data as an independent data
          controller for its own statistical measurement purposes. The legal basis for processing
          is the user's consent, revocable at any time from the "Cookie preferences" link in the
          footer. The cookies set are <code class="text-[0.85em]">_ga</code>
          {' '}(visitor identifier, 24-month duration) and <code class="text-[0.85em]">_ga_&lt;CONTAINER-ID&gt;</code>
          {' '}(session status, 24-month duration).
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5">
          The Contacts page includes an interactive map (OpenFreeMap, via the maplibre-gl
          library): to display it, only the map tile images are requested from the server
          {' '}<code class="text-[0.85em]">tiles.openfreemap.org</code>, which receives the IP
          address needed to serve them but sets no cookies or trackers.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-subhead mt-10">Purpose and legal basis</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Data provided by phone or email is processed solely to respond to the user's request, on
          the basis of the Data Controller's legitimate interest in managing incoming business
          contacts or, where applicable, the pre-contractual measures requested by the data
          subject.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-subhead mt-10">Retention</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Data is retained for as long as necessary to manage the request and any resulting
          business relationship, subject to statutory tax and accounting obligations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-subhead mt-10">Data subject rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Users may request access, rectification, erasure or restriction of processing of their
          data at any time by writing to {contatti.email} or {contatti.pec}.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
